Description: net's Linux DNS configuration reader needs glibc's res_ninit and the internals of its struct __res_state: on musl the build takes the Fuchsia reader instead (an empty configuration).
Forwarded: not-needed (Alpine's musl patch; Alpine carries it)
Origin: Alpine Linux aports ecc3ce96955f459cf819602db39593b42ded8515, community/chromium/disable-dns_config_service.patch
Rebased to apply exactly (Jam OS's applier takes no fuzz): the body below is the same change made again by diff -u against this tarball.

--- a/net/dns/BUILD.gn
+++ b/net/dns/BUILD.gn
@@ -173,8 +173,8 @@
     ]
   } else if (is_linux) {
     sources += [
-      "dns_config_service_linux.cc",
-      "dns_config_service_linux.h",
+      "dns_config_service_fuchsia.cc",
+      "dns_config_service_fuchsia.h",
     ]
   } else if (is_posix) {
     sources += [
@@ -487,7 +487,6 @@
       "mock_dns_platform_android_attempt_delegate.h",
     ]
   } else if (is_linux) {
-    sources += [ "dns_config_service_linux_unittest.cc" ]
   } else if (is_posix) {
     sources += [ "dns_config_service_posix_unittest.cc" ]
   }
